{
  "$comment": "Account settings document: remaining-quota thresholds keyed by an opaque 12-hex selector, reset/pace switches, an optional monthly budget amount, and `history.sync` (default false). A document without `history` normalizes to `sync: false`. `history` omitted from a write means unchanged. The switch is never seeded from a device. `normalize` is the stored document or a refusal. `first_sync` is what a device does the first time it sees an Account document (seed / adopt / adopt_and_merge). `reapply` is the one local edit replayed onto the fresh document after a 412. TypeScript (`packages/quota-model`), Swift, and Rust each answer this file. See ADR 0061 and ADR 0062.",
  "normalize": [
    {
      "name": "a valid pair and a two-decimal budget are stored as written",
      "input": {
        "alerts": {
          "reset_reminders": true,
          "pace_alerts": true,
          "thresholds": {
            "a1b2c3d4e5f6": [20, 10]
          }
        },
        "budget": {
          "amount_usd": "250.00",
          "alerts": true
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "ok": {
          "alerts": {
            "reset_reminders": true,
            "pace_alerts": true,
            "thresholds": {
              "a1b2c3d4e5f6": [20, 10]
            }
          },
          "budget": {
            "amount_usd": "250.00",
            "alerts": true
          },
          "history": {
            "sync": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "an empty thresholds map is the stored default, and no budget is null",
      "input": {
        "alerts": {
          "reset_reminders": true,
          "pace_alerts": true,
          "thresholds": {}
        },
        "budget": {
          "amount_usd": null,
          "alerts": true
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "ok": {
          "alerts": {
            "reset_reminders": true,
            "pace_alerts": true,
            "thresholds": {}
          },
          "budget": {
            "amount_usd": null,
            "alerts": true
          },
          "history": {
            "sync": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
